    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thief with this talent receives a +10 feet bonus to her base movement speed. This benefit applies only when she is wearing no armor, light armor, or medium armor, and not carrying a heavy load. Apply this bonus before modifying the thief's speed because of any load carried or armor worn. If the thief gains the fast movement class feature from another class, the bonuses to her speed do not stack.</p>",
